// Título: HackTool - WinRM Access Via Evil-WinRM
// Descripción: Adversaries may use Valid Accounts to log into a computer using the Remote Desktop Protocol (RDP). The adversary may then perform actions as the logged-on user.
// Fecha de creación: 2022-01-07
